></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visceral Dream Sequence </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve small drag-and-drop puzzles while immersed in visceral dream sequences of the vanished \u201cmermaid.\u201d Witness the forgotten story emerging from beautifully intangible streams of consciousness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957410/extras/22ca7df5347775b3dd8f1aff73c8b571.poster.avif?t=1754056920\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957410/extras/22ca7df5347775b3dd8f1aff73c8b571.webm?t=1754056920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Love is an investment. This is a story for those who have the deepest love for things that are not present. We miss the things that are not here, and this drives us insane. We have different mechanisms to process this, and this game proposes two of them: 1, Keep talking to people, and 2, Keep making paintings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*By the way, the game can make you laugh a lot, especially at inappropriate moments.</p>",
